# c6320 (2026-11-10): victim 4,6; Secondary = the burner's threads 12,14,16,18 (motiv2/burner-node4-c6320.yaml).
# hc-int: HC for the intrinsic scenario of the motivation pass 3 -- hc-hold (applied once at
# enable, never released) with a SMALL Secondary list = the threads of the hc-secondary-burner
# pod (motiv2/burner-node4.yaml), so that the burner is oversubscribed on its own threads and
# visibly consumes whatever the Balancer lends from the victim's idle threads 18-20.
